    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so exhausting. like i'm performing \"being a person\" every single day but there's nobody actually home. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the guy looking back. it's like the version of me that mattered is just... gone. what's the point of keeping up the act when the person i was is dead anyway?",
